  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.32 - on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.51. NEW ModelResidency: keeps models on the device while there is room within one budget (the accelerator's own), drops the least recently used idle one when the next needs the room, loads it again on next use; leases, tags, registered engines, lost-device recovery; InferenceSession.DeviceBytes; FLUX.2, FLUX 3 and LTX lease their weights from it (Residency). Browser cold start: kernels load on first use, fp32 convolutions on the direct implicit GEMM (a 308 KB shader is gone): MobileNetV2 first visit 8.3 s to 2.0 s in Chrome. Convolutions: Conv and BatchNorm folded, Relu and Clip(0,6) applied in the conv stores, small-output and 1x1 convolutions on faster kernels. WebGPU: SkipCompletionWait on by default (one round trip fewer per run). IModelSource.GetSizeAsync.",
